@startuml Trampoline Routing Flow
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor      #CC0000
    LifeLineBorderColor #888888
    ParticipantBorderColor #555555
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor  #CCCCCC
    BoxBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
}

title Trampoline Pattern — URL Routing Flow\n(High-Level)

actor       "User"                                  as User
participant "External App\n(Gmail / SMS / Browser)" as ExtApp  #FFE8E8
participant "Android OS\nIntent Router"             as OS      #E8F0FF
participant "TrampolineActivity\n(Traffic Cop)"     as TA      #FFDDDD
participant "PathClassifier\n+ RoutingConfig"       as PC      #FFF3E0
participant "BrowserResolver"                       as BR      #E8FFE8

box "Routed Destinations" #F0F8FF
  participant "DeepLink\nDestinationActivity" as DL  #DDEEFF
  participant "Chrome\nCustom Tab"            as CCT #DDEEFF
  participant "System\nBrowser"               as SB  #DDEEFF
end box

== 1. User taps a link ==

User    ->  ExtApp : taps staples.com link
ExtApp  ->  OS     : fires ACTION_VIEW intent\nhttps://www.staples.com/<path>

note over OS
  App Link verification check.
  Domain must be marked **verified**
  (via adb override or assetlinks.json).
end note

OS      ->  TA     : delivers intent to\nTrampolineActivity\n(invisible — Theme.Transparent)

== 2. Classification ==

TA      ->  PC     : classify(uri)

note right of PC
  Checks **uri.path** against
  **DEFAULT_CONFIG** prefix lists:
  ----
  appDeepLinkPrefixes:
    /product/, /p/, /c/, /deals/, /s/
  authPrefixes:
    /idm/api/*, /login, /signin, /auth/
  browserOnlyPrefixes:
    /lp/*, /legal/, /unsubscribe, ...
  ----
  Returns a **RouteBucket** sealed class.
end note

PC      --> TA     : RouteBucket result

== 3. Routing ==

alt RouteBucket.AppDeepLink
    TA  ->  DL  : startActivity(\n  DeepLinkDestinationActivity\n  + EXTRA_PATH)

else RouteBucket.Auth
    TA  ->  BR  : resolveCustomTabsPackage()
    BR  --> TA  : chrome package (or fallback browser)
    TA  ->  CCT : CustomTabsIntent\n.launchUrl(uri, package=chrome)

else RouteBucket.BrowserOnly
    TA  ->  BR  : resolveDefaultBrowserPackage()

    note right of BR
      **Cycle Prevention (Discovery):**
      1. Asks OS: "Who is the default handler?"
      2. If OS says "**StaplesApp**", it finds the
         **next best** browser (Chrome, Firefox).
      3. Returns that browser package name.
    end note

    BR  --> TA  : browser package name (e.g. "com.android.chrome")

    TA  ->  SB  : startActivity(\n  ACTION_VIEW + **setPackage(browser)**)
    
    note right of TA
      **Cycle Prevention (Handoff):**
      By switching from **Implicit** to **Explicit**
      addressing (via ""setPackage""), we "force" the
      intent to the browser. This prevents our app
      from intercepting its own intent again.
    end note

else RouteBucket.AuthCallback
    TA  ->  TA  : handleAuthCallback(uri)\n[POC: logs only;\n production: extract OAuth token]

else RouteBucket.Unknown
    TA  ->  BR  : resolveDefaultBrowserPackage()
    TA  ->  SB  : fallback browser
end

== 4. Cleanup ==

TA -> TA : finish()\nnoHistory=true → removed\nfrom back-stack instantly

note over TA
  No UI shown. No back-stack entry.
  User never "sees" TrampolineActivity.
end note

@enduml
